    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ad4f1e8e30ce1f8440d078",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们的情谊不会动摇。\n就算面对历史悠久的比赛也不会惧怕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e6d9f81b927dccb64c4ea752c7a6e56c2856c977ceaa3cd2a9fa69ca450162",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
