      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“天皇赏（秋）”的权威中大闹一场，\n让大家见识她自天皇赏（春）后的成长吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "510bdc452f9e00c4be6f537a923c29c2b3e46b2ff399f0dbfd218ba28a12496b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064320.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a6542e2149f8fa7b77798e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冲击──传遍了全场。\n领头赛马娘通常都是单独领先支配比赛。\n但这个常识却被打破了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c513c3911e9479f03052075691a98975fb80275daf0ae43d9aa23536d0d18ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064320.json",
      "json_path": [
